		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Repulsion Armor</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — Armor that lashes back at melee attackers.</em></p><p><strong>Free Reaction.</strong> When you Defend, a Melee attacker takes STRd8 Force damage.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> A Huge or smaller attacker is pushed away STR spaces.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> +1 Armor.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Rolls STRd8 Force against the melee attacker.</em></p><p><em>[M] Push a Huge or smaller attacker STR spaces away.</em></p>",
